---
import { site } from '../site.config';

// One variant per platform; CSS shows the one matching <html data-platform>,
// which is set before first paint (see Base.astro).
const variants = site.platforms.map((p) => ({
  id: p.id,
  label: p.available ? p.heroLabel : `Coming soon to ${p.name}`,
  href: p.available ? p.url : `#download-${p.id}`,
  available: p.available,
}));
---

<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="copy">
      <h1 id="hero-title">Pick up exactly where you left off.</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        Read PDFs and EPUBs in a calm, distraction-free space that keeps your place in sync across all your
        devices.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        {
          variants.map((v) => (
            <a
              class={`btn ${v.available ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-secondary'} cta-variant`}
              data-for={v.id}
              href={v.href}
            >
              {v.label}
            </a>
          ))
        }
        <a class="btn btn-primary cta-variant" data-for="unknown" href="#download">All platforms</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary cta-all" href="#download">All platforms</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="device">
        <div class="screen">
          <div class="pill">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 2.4-5.7" /><path d="M4 4v4h4" /></svg>
            Resumed on page 187
          </div>
          <div class="page">
            <p class="chapter">Chapter Eleven</p>
            <div class="text">
              <p>
                The house was quiet in the way that only early mornings allow. She set the cup down beside the
                window and opened the book to the page she had marked with nothing at all, trusting that she
                would remember, and she did. The sentence waited for her exactly where she had left it the night
                before, halfway through a thought about the sea.
              </p>
              <p>
                Outside, the light came slowly over the rooftops. A bicycle passed, then another. Somewhere a
                door closed. None of it reached her for long. There is a kind of attention that belongs only to
                reading, patient and unhurried, and it returned to her now the way a tide returns to a familiar
                shore, without asking and without fuss.
              </p>
              <p>
                She read on. The chapter turned toward the harbour, toward the boats and the old man who mended
                nets, and she followed it gladly, one line and then the next.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="folio">187</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-top: 72px;
    padding-bottom: var(--section);
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 112px;
    }
  }

  .copy {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 44px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: 56px;
      line-height: 64px;
    }
  }

  .sub {
    margin: 20px auto 0;
    max-width: 560px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 30px;
  }

  .actions {
    margin-top: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .cta-variant {
    display: none;
  }

  :global(html[data-platform='android']) .cta-variant[data-for='android'],
  :global(html[data-platform='mac']) .cta-variant[data-for='mac'],
  :global(html[data-platform='windows']) .cta-variant[data-for='windows'],
  :global(html[data-platform='iphone']) .cta-variant[data-for='iphone'],
  :global(html[data-platform='unknown']) .cta-variant[data-for='unknown'],
  :global(html:not([data-platform])) .cta-variant[data-for='unknown'] {
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  :global(html[data-platform='unknown']) .cta-all,
  :global(html:not([data-platform])) .cta-all {
    display: none;
  }

  /* Product visual */
  .visual {
    margin: 64px auto 0;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .device {
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow:
      0 1px 2px rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.04),
      0 24px 60px -24px rgba(60, 40, 20, 0.22);
  }

  .screen {
    container-type: inline-size;
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 13px;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: left;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .screen {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    }
  }

  .pill {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--paper-ink);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(122, 90, 58, 0.18);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .pill svg {
    flex: none;
  }

  .page {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    padding: 64px 9cqi 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-family: var(--font-book);
    color: var(--paper-ink);
    font-size: 4.3cqi;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .page {
      padding: 13cqi 0 0;
      width: 56%;
      left: 22%;
      font-size: 2.05cqi;
    }
  }

  .chapter {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.82em;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.4em;
  }

  .text {
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: justify;
    hyphens: auto;
    -webkit-hyphens: auto;
  }

  .text p + p {
    text-indent: 1.5em;
  }

  .folio {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--paper);
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    opacity: 0.9;
    padding: 0.9em 0 1.4em;
    box-shadow: 0 -1.6em 0 var(--paper);
  }
</style>
